  "prompt": "Marketing is reviewing its seasonal audio campaigns. Promotion names are typed by hand, so words can appear in any mix of upper and lower case. From the promotions table, return four columns, in this order: promo_code, promo_name, promo_type, discount_pct. Keep only the promotions whose promo_name contains spring or contains audio, in any letter case, and whose promo_type is percent_off. Every promotion has a promo_name and a promo_type. Show discount_pct exactly as stored, without rounding. Return one row per promotion. Any row order is fine.",
